TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"line-height:1.8;\" id=\"SE-dfc870b7-0b27-4add-bb36-a686419b12b4\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic  se-style-unset \" id=\"SE-9fd8eca5-aeed-4e15-86d7-3cecad01493b\">게임을 완전히 종료하신 후 재접속하여</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"line-height:1.8;\" id=\"SE-7a9822df-1120-498e-8244-9d999f1ddc19\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic  se-style-unset \" id=\"SE-06d0ffc4-2b12-4f32-ac7a-059a7cd47009\">업데이트 리소스를 다운로드해 주시기 바랍니다.</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"line-height:1.8;\" id=\"SE-bcde7d40-1134-4401-af52-1203f78c57ae\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic  se-style-unset \" id=\"SE-809069b4-2861-4f81-83e8-9ac824a733ce\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"line-height:1.8;\" id=\"SE-e21ff888-efdf-4e4a-971c-683e9b52bed3\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic  se-style-unset \" id=\"SE-02f85c8a-f329-412c-b25a-ef8f952434cb\">​​자세한 설명은 아래를 확인해 주시기 바랍니다.​​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"line-height:1.8;\" id=\"SE-df33704a-8ab0-4a61-ae37-a839bb1242e3\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic  se-style-unset \" id=\"SE-12c89ae3-d25a-4f71-9610-dd6a3cb08389\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"line-height:1.8;\" id=\"SE-a6b6f160-e1f0-40c7-975d-83c228ebe20b\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic  se-style-unset \" id=\"SE-72acfa93-d5e8-4f4a-a810-a9eb8987c7a0\">​·····················································································</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"line-height:1.8;\" id=\"SE-38d417ab-04e3-4f06-ad1d-5737bbd906ea\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs15 se-ff-nanumgothic  se-style-unset \" id=\"SE-264e1837-72d0-40f5-b656-f2cac1c65212\"><b>📢 1월 17일(금) 무점검 업데이트 안내​​​</b></span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"line-height:1.8;\" id=\"SE-b2ace82b-2fed-450d-9ed0-01e62a0771c9\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic  se-style-unset \" id=\"SE-7aa39a87-ff8b-4935-b4e5-f60db856d774\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"line-height:1.8;\" id=\"SE-f14c7ae9-4176-4cf1-b5d3-dbba7d7b29e8\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic  se-style-unset \" id=\"SE-b9300f46-b15e-4bfd-869f-821733d0044e\"><b>​✔️ 일시</b></span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"line-height:1.8;\" id=\"SE-cac9ade7-0bc2-4e92-af3c-9c046b1d19f6\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic  se-style-unset \" id=\"SE-b87b3da7-76c0-414f-98d8-6d9450352264\">- 1/17(금) 22:00 ~ 23:50경​​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"line-height:1.8;\" id=\"SE-912ec2ba-23f9-4d13-97d7-08203bef8ee3\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic  se-style-unset \" id=\"SE-8f830858-efd1-4622-8f03-c3b9dbf420c9\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"line-height:1.8;\" id=\"SE-450fe82d-d399-4b11-a898-584c2d7f3845\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic  se-style-unset \" id=\"SE-bad909d1-6542-4f56-b535-8528ef44959e\"><b>​✔️ 내용</b></span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"line-height:1.8;\" id=\"SE-9653323d-6a26-450c-b45c-53f446f3ef9d\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic  se-style-unset \" id=\"SE-487f5ab5-1762-42eb-aabc-4c88d3e44eb8\">​1. 시뮬레이션 룸 오버클럭의 랩쳐가 의도와 다른 코드로 등장하는 현상을 수정하였습니다.</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-c4a77983-c30e-4ef2-b607-08325b17bc79\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic  se-style-unset \" id=\"SE-c3f73bba-89e8-4860-9238-4001803b010b\">2. 시뮬레이션 룸 오버클럭에서 에너지 폭주 옵션을 활성화 시, 간헐적으로 캔슬링이 표시되지 않아 광역 공격을 저지할 수 없는 현상을 수정하였습니다. </span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-f96abdba-1757-452d-a1a0-ac3cc1a8723a\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic  se-style-unset \" id=\"SE-b3369522-4d3b-4fba-b76e-8b0436edf8e6\">3. 간헐적으로 스페셜 아레나 전투 진입이 불가능한 현상을 임시 조치하였습니다. </span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-b97da1dd-0466-4606-be78-0ddc20358287\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic  se-style-unset \" id=\"SE-33f71f5b-cd49-42dc-b909-04a18ea1547c\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"line-height:1.8;\" id=\"SE-2da407ac-80e9-4fd5-80e5-a3e72d73ebc3\"><span style=\"color:#ba0000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic  se-style-unset \" id=\"SE-d47e160d-6c51-4c7c-a1fe-c801cc1c7a7a\">​​※ 게임 재접속 후 업데이트 리소스 다운로드를 부탁드립니다.</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"line-height:1.8;\" id=\"SE-543729f5-9e95-411e-864c-88beb9e7abcc\"><span style=\"color:#ba0000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic  se-style-unset \" id=\"SE-4eb62158-58c8-45df-87d9-9755f59e1db5\">​※ 인앱 구매(확률형 아이템 포함)​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"line-height:1.8;\" id=\"SE-cc970093-2684-4864-b2f2-3ab580eebbd0\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic  se-style-unset \" id=\"SE-1cde0add-e7cb-418d-9680-0fc65628a0de\">·····················································································​​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"line-height:1.8;\" id=\"SE-19d41cb7-fc37-4947-9985-70ed7e562617\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic  se-style-unset \" id=\"SE-3eb1015c-0974-4d79-925e-1406cfe4ea50\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"line-height:1.8;\" id=\"SE-c7eea5e7-7181-4ad0-a989-179d07158a5e\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic  se-style-unset \" id=\"SE-8b037f17-bc05-4c23-b957-35d153b9a2c8\">​게임 이용에 불편을 끼쳐 드려 죄송합니다.</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-7960d20d-dc04-48c4-8cf4-7ed674108e85\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-31fac7f1-615b-4380-a166-b72bb1665fba\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT -->\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>                <div class=\"se-component se-image se-l-default\" id=\"SE-b5da926a-e210-4bba-9e25-d7139bf79ac0\">\n                    <div class=\"se-component-content se-component-content-normal\">\n                        <div class=\"se-section se-section-image se-l-default se-section-align-\" style=\"max-width:100px;\">\n                                <div class=\"se-module se-module-image\" style=\"\">\n                                    <a href=\"#\" class=\"se-module-image-link __se_image_link __se_link\" s